        "TileImage": "$($repository d262ec9c-97d0-4d92-97a6-f2f9e0378b86).Image",
        "Description": "In briny halls where dull winds sigh,\rThere dwelleth Squidwardbobi, lone and dry.\rWith visage sour and spirit worn,\rHe curseth tides from dusk till morn.\rHis clarion wail, a mournful art,\rDoth pierce the deep and vex each heart.\r\r“Alas,” quoth he, “this wretched fate,\rTo dwell ‘mid fools I cannot sate!”\rYet still he plays, by shadow’d light,\rA tune both grim and strangely bright.\r\rO Squidwardbobi, soul austere,\rThy gloom yet draweth many near.",
